  "_comment": "Single source of truth for the generated data format, read by src/core/constants.js and scripts/data/*.py. Changing an order here changes the meaning of src/data/items.json: re-run `npm run regen` afterwards. `sources`: bit i of an item row's source mask is sources[i], the groups the optimizer can leave out, in the order the page shows them: set when the piece's category (scripts/data/gear_categories.py) is in `categories`, or when gear_sources.py flags it (crafted, tomestone, ultimate). `currentOnly`: only pieces of the current expansion, whose equip level is the highest in the database. A slot's `blocks` lists the slot types it leaves empty (code 12: a body piece that also covers the head; a `twoHanded` weapon blocks the off-hand). Slot `percent` is the share of the ItemLevel budget in thousandths; gen_item_level.py checks it against the `baseParamColumn` of every stat row in BaseParam.csv.",
